WEBVTT

00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:14.620
Oh, man. Just because we received a
message about some restless Roshi,

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:16.120
we had to come all the way here.

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:19.130
Nothing happened. It's so boring.

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:20.160
Right, Hajime-kun?

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:25.440
Have you noticed that when Okita-san walks with Saitou-san, he's always on the right?

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:30.170
Is that because the Third Division Captain, Saitou-san,

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:34.420
respects the First Division Captain as a kenjutsu instructor?

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:36.430
No, that's because-

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:41.420
Captain!

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:44.770
Are you Okita Souji of the Shinsengumi?

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:48.060
And if I am? Do you have business with me?

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:52.820
How arrogant. Today, I shall avenge Miyabe-sensei.

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:55.700
Huh? I don't remember him.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:57.070
Who was that again?

00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:00.950
Damn it. He's looking down on us! Get him!

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:17.800
Fansubbed by Ruri Subs

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:22.640
Fansubbed by Ruri Subs

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:52.030
Huh?

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:53.530
What?

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:56.690
Looks like we overdid it.

00:02:57.770 --> 00:03:01.010
We can't let Chizuru-chan see this, right?

00:03:02.430 --> 00:03:03.470
I guess so.

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:06.920
If we catch a cold because of this,

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:08.830
it'll be Hijikata-san's fault, right?

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:13.710
Hijikata-san was the one who brought Chizuru-chan here, wasn't he?

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:23.470
Chapter One
White Snow of
the Dark Night

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:28.600
m 0 0 l 0 0 l 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 -10 l 0 -10

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:28.600
January, Keio Era, 1867

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:28.600
Stop it!

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:30.800
Ah, it's Souji!

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:31.600
Souji!

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:33.210
Souji, let's play!

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:35.770
No can do. I'm busy.

00:03:36.490 --> 00:03:38.330
Eh? You're so boring.

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:39.600
Wait, Souji!

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:40.610
Souji!

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:47.350
Now I can't run away, no matter how fast I am.

00:03:47.350 --> 00:03:49.870
We did it! We caught you!

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:51.790
Looks like you did.

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:54.870
Come on! Let's play!

00:03:57.380 --> 00:04:00.460
Then I guess I'll play for a bit.

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:01.760
Yeah!

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.400
Come on! Hurry up!

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:04.380
Sure, sure.

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:09.010
Okita-san, is it okay to play with the kids in the headquarters?

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:11.520
Huh?

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:15.270
Everyone is still working inside.

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:16.580
That's true.

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:20.670
If Hijikata-san sees this, he'll certainly get angry.

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:22.780
Onii-chan, let's play together.

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:25.280
Huh? Onii-chan?

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:31.810
The Shinsengumi doesn't have any important work, anyway.

00:04:31.810 --> 00:04:34.570
Eh? That's not true.

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:39.450
They patrol the city of Kyoto every day to catch bad people.

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:40.670
It's not easy!

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:43.280
You liar! My daddy told me

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:46.550
they're always going to the Shimabara brothel to have fun.

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:51.560
Eh? I-I don't think everyone's like that, though.

00:04:52.570 --> 00:04:56.810
Well, you can't deny that some are like that.

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:59.160
And they're always full of themselves.

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:01.380
Every one of them is scary.

00:05:02.130 --> 00:05:03.820
Th-That's not...

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:09.820
Well, yeah. Hijikata-san always furrows his eyebrows with that serious look.

00:05:09.820 --> 00:05:13.330
Okita-san, whose side are you on?

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:20.460
I know! Kondou-san!

00:05:21.390 --> 00:05:26.720
The commander, Kondou-san, is a very kind and gentle person.

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:28.080
Kondou?

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:29.270
Who's that?

00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:32.220
Ah, he's that super slow guy.

00:05:33.710 --> 00:05:35.730
Somehow, he doesn't seem reliable.

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:38.320
That's right. He looks weak.

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:40.920
Eh? That's not true!

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:43.480
Kondou-san is a very good person!

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:44.740
Right, Okita-san?

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:46.490
Eh?

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:49.490
Come on! Say something, Okita-san!

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:52.360
Well, they're just kids.

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:54.950
Calm down a little, Chizuru-chan.

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:55.870
But...

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:58.670
Hey, Souji. Let's play already.

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:00.620
Let's play! Let's play!

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:02.000
All right, come on.

00:06:02.970 --> 00:06:03.970
Ready?

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:05.380
Fly, fly!

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:13.970
Amazing!

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:17.590
When you get to a height you don't see every day, it's interesting, right?

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:23.390
Um, yeah.

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:31.520
B-But this is enough. Let me down.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:36.160
Why? Isn't this interesting?

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.970
Souji...

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:47.770
Let me down.

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:49.170
Okita-san?

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:51.020
S-Souji?

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:54.180
L-Let me down.

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:05.670
What's wrong? You don't have to cry because you're happy.

00:07:05.670 --> 00:07:08.330
Okita-san, please stop.

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:09.320
Why should I?

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:12.050
Isn't he frightened?

00:07:12.050 --> 00:07:14.820
Please let him down.

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:22.830
Oh, man, just when we were having a nice time.

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:27.630
Wait!

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:29.710
Hey, wait!

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:31.690
Sorry, kids!

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:36.740
Okita-san, why did you do that?

00:07:36.740 --> 00:07:39.570
Weren't you getting along very well with them?

00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:43.300
It's because they treat Kondou-san like an idiot.

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:51.420
But now, I guess those kids won't try to play with me again.

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:54.020
Okita-san.

00:07:55.860 --> 00:07:57.990
Could it be because of his illness?

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:02.520
Now then, it's time for patrols, Chizuru-chan.

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:05.290
Get ready now, or I'll leave you behind.

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:06.510
Ah, all right!

00:08:07.030 --> 00:08:08.990
Yes, it's tasty.

00:08:08.990 --> 00:08:11.000
What do you think? It's not bad, ya know?

00:08:14.980 --> 00:08:16.380
Chizuru-chan!

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:19.970
Osen-chan!

00:08:22.630 --> 00:08:25.740
What a coincidence. Are you on patrol?

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:26.460
Yup.

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:28.440
Chizuru-chan, who is this?

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:32.360
Ah, well...

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:37.210
My name's Osen. You could say I'm a dango friend of Chizuru-chan.

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:43.050
I didn't realize you knew someone in this city.

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:48.170
Good timing. I'm planning on going to the headquarters a bit later.

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:51.790
Actually, I heard from a Geiko acquaintance

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:57.300
that unfamiliar Roshi have been frequently making use of the Sumiya as of late,

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:02.270
discussing dangerous things like attacking the Shinsengumi.

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:06.850
That sounds like another very interesting story.

00:09:07.430 --> 00:09:11.460
Why would you come just to tell us this?

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:17.160
Because I'm worried about Chizuru-chan, of course!

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:19.140
Thank you, Osen-chan.

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:20.200
Sure.

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:22.050
Really?

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:24.330
Though you say that,

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:28.960
the Shinsengumi can't just hide in Shimabara.

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:35.340
That's right. Hey, can you do some work for me?

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:36.420
Huh?

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:43.660
Remember, during the summer you did well going to the Sumiya dressed as a Geiko.

00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:45.780
Eh? Really?!

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:47.600
Ah, no. Not at all-

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:51.670
I wish I could see Chizuru-chan as a Geiko!

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:53.600
You'd fit right in!

00:09:53.600 --> 00:09:56.740
You must be pretty. I really wanna see it!

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:58.610
No, but... Um, really...

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:00.630
That's what she said. What do you think?

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:03.020
Eh?!

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:11.120
And then Chizuru-chan said she would try doing it.

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:13.120
Right, Chizuru-chan?

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:14.700
Ah, yes.

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:20.840
I see. I more or less understand the situation.

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:23.230
So, what do you think, Toshi?

00:10:23.230 --> 00:10:27.270
I've also heard about the commotion in Shimabara.

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:31.400
However, finding the location is hard.

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:34.270
I was just thinking about how we could find them.

00:10:34.270 --> 00:10:35.250
I got it.

00:10:36.180 --> 00:10:39.830
In that case, we should use this chance to search.

00:10:39.830 --> 00:10:42.050
Good. Gather everyone up.

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:53.760
All right, I'm counting on you guys.

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:55.130
Yes.

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:57.280
Chizuru, good luck.

00:10:57.280 --> 00:11:00.150
If something happens, I'll jump in immediately.

00:11:00.150 --> 00:11:01.130
Me too.

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:02.370
Okay.

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:06.050
Hold on! What do you mean by something happening?

00:11:06.050 --> 00:11:07.860
Sano-san! Shinpachi-san!

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:10.360
Heisuke, you're annoying.

00:11:10.360 --> 00:11:14.730
If you worry too much, Chizuru will feel uneasy.

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:16.150
But...

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:17.770
Don't worry.

00:11:17.770 --> 00:11:20.430
Saitou and Yamazaki will be following her.

00:11:20.430 --> 00:11:21.900
Right, Saitou?

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:23.660
Yes.

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:25.660
I know, but...

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:29.410
Chizuru, you don't have to force yourself, okay?

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:31.490
Thank you, Heisuke-kun.

00:11:31.490 --> 00:11:33.400
Isn't that fine?

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:38.290
It's much more interesting than getting stuck here like me.

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:41.260
Thanks to some overly worried guy,

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:45.430
I have to remain bored and stand by at headquarters.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:50.000
Souji, if you have a problem with that, then cure your cold.

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:52.680
Weren't you coughing in your room this morning?

00:11:52.680 --> 00:11:56.590
Yeah, yeah. Lucky to be you, Hijikata-san.

00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:58.590
You never catch a cold, right?

00:11:58.590 --> 00:12:00.190
How enviable.

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:03.930
Are you trying to say that idiots don't catch colds?

00:12:03.930 --> 00:12:05.200
Who knows?

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:08.470
Well, a cold is the root of all illnesses.

00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:11.820
During this period, you should rest properly, Souji.

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:13.320
I guess so.

00:12:13.320 --> 00:12:15.130
So, Chizuru-chan,

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:17.580
enjoy yourself for my sake as well.

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:18.920
Okay.

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:24.720
Chizuru, be careful!

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:31.220
Somehow, I feel like my daughter is getting married.

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:34.730
Rather than a daughter, she's more like a little sister.

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:39.230
To me, this is more like seeing a warrior off to the battlefield.

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:43.990
Oh, Chizuru-chan. Maybe we'll never see each other again.

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:46.340
Hey, stop that, Souji!

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:47.490
It'll bring bad luck.

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:52.990
Well then, what should I do to kill time?

00:12:53.510 --> 00:12:55.390
Let's start making preparations, too.

00:12:55.390 --> 00:12:58.770
Yeah. Heisuke, hurry up.

00:12:58.770 --> 00:13:01.000
Ah, wait a moment!

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:02.050
I'll leave you behind!

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:02.970
Hey, Sano-san!

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:33.390
How long can I stay by your side?

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:51.220
Can you still go on?

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:52.050
Yes.

00:13:55.590 --> 00:13:57.810
Thank you for your patronage.

00:13:57.810 --> 00:13:59.560
Hold it, Souji!

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:01.460
Don't misunderstand!

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:08.190
Chizuru-chan, I heard about it.

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:10.540
It was very lively that day.

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:15.700
Everyone at Shimabara was totally staring at you.

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:17.470
N-Not at all.

00:14:17.470 --> 00:14:19.250
Yeah, they were.

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:22.730
You were cute. Chizuru-chan's the best.

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:23.710
Right, Saitou?

00:14:25.770 --> 00:14:26.900
Yeah.

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:32.020
Please stop it. Even you, Saitou-san...

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:32.970
This is really...

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:39.230
But I didn't really think that Yamazaki would do that.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:41.100
What happened, Hajime-kun?

00:14:41.100 --> 00:14:42.440
What did he do?

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:44.230
Oh, I heard about that!

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:46.230
This here, right?

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:48.740
Tatami Iwashi?

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:53.360
To Shinpachi, that's a great thing.

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:56.610
What? This is unnecessary to me.

00:14:56.610 --> 00:15:00.000
Huh? I don't get you at all.

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:06.500
Fine. I'll ask him in person when he gets back.

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:08.760
Chizuru-chan, please don't hold back.

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:11.080
This is delicious. Eat as much as you like.

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:12.510
Ah, okay!

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:15.510
That's right, since it's Shinpachi-san's treat.

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:19.240
My treat? Well, sure, I guess.

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:25.600
Now of all times?!

00:15:27.170 --> 00:15:28.780
Saitou...

00:15:30.510 --> 00:15:32.780
No problem. Leave it to me.

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:34.780
Thank you.

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:41.760
We gotta keep on drinking in Shimabara this winter, though.

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:44.870
We were invited by Itou-san for the new year, right?

00:15:45.530 --> 00:15:46.540
Yeah.

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:47.740
What's with that?

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:49.800
He didn't invite me, though.

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:52.920
That's 'cause you'd cut him down immediately.

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:56.480
Well, I <i>would</i> cut him.

00:15:57.750 --> 00:15:59.470
Thank you for coming!

00:16:00.780 --> 00:16:02.460
Thank you for your hospitality.

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:04.180
Is this really all right?

00:16:04.180 --> 00:16:05.760
Sure thing.

00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:06.940
Right, Saitou?

00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:11.450
All right, next place!

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:18.320
Though he said, "Chizuru-chan has to eat something good once in a while,"

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:21.630
in the end, Shinpachi just wanted to go himself.

00:16:21.630 --> 00:16:23.330
It's fine, isn't it?

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:27.040
We're very fortunate to happily drink sake.

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:29.330
Hey, bastard!

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:31.340
You hit me and won't even apologize?

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:33.940
Oh, sorry. My bad.

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:35.090
Hold it.

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:36.970
Why don't you apologize seriously?

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:42.730
What? Didn't I properly apologize?

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:47.850
Since my muscles are so perfect, you want to cut them, or what?

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:51.890
What perfect muscles?

00:16:51.890 --> 00:16:53.670
That's nothing.

00:16:56.140 --> 00:16:57.460
What did you say?!

00:16:57.460 --> 00:16:59.280
What? You wanna go at it?

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:00.930
Let's go, Chizuru-chan.

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:02.480
Ah, okay.

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:04.870
But Nagakura-san is...

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:08.120
Don't worry, it's Shinpachi-san.

00:17:08.950 --> 00:17:10.090
You bastard!

00:17:13.150 --> 00:17:16.510
I-It doesn't look all right to me at all.

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:21.770
Don't worry. That's just Shinpachi-san having fun.

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:23.260
Eh? But...

00:17:24.880 --> 00:17:27.550
Don't get cocky, you bastards!

00:17:27.550 --> 00:17:28.790
Eat this!

00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:33.770
Souji, I'll take Shinpachi back.

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:35.150
I'll leave Yukimura to you.

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:37.630
Sure, sure. Chizuru-chan, let's go.

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:38.870
Ah, okay.

00:17:44.650 --> 00:17:48.910
Okita-san, will Nagakura-san really be all right?

00:17:48.910 --> 00:17:52.280
Yes, he will. Hajime-kun is with him, anyway.

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:54.060
It happens all the time.

00:17:54.060 --> 00:17:55.670
Really?

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:59.930
Since Heisuke and Sano-san aren't there, it's pretty mild.

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:05.280
If the three of them were together, there would've been an even greater uproar.

00:18:10.280 --> 00:18:11.840
Okita-san?

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:13.560
I'm all right. It'll be fine in a moment.

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:21.820
Okita-san!

00:18:21.820 --> 00:18:24.950
Just kidding. It's nothing.

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:28.550
How mean, Okita-san!

00:18:28.550 --> 00:18:30.960
Please don't do this ever again!

00:18:34.430 --> 00:18:36.420
Chizuru-chan, wait for me.

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:37.840
I won't!

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:47.420
Chizuru-chan, if you move that fast,

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:50.610
you'll miss this rare view.

00:18:59.890 --> 00:19:00.930
Snow.

00:19:01.590 --> 00:19:02.480
Right?

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:06.320
It's beautiful.

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:11.760
If it continues falling like this, covering everything

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:14.900
and turning everything white,

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:18.420
it'd be great, like being reborn.

00:19:38.020 --> 00:19:39.550
Souji, are you free?

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:42.740
Kondou-san.

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:44.170
Chizuru-chan, too.

00:19:44.170 --> 00:19:45.410
What's wrong?

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:50.790
Well, Toshi told me that you don't have an appetite.

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:54.370
That's why I asked Yukimura-kun to make some porridge.

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:58.020
Seriously, someone's worrying too much again.

00:19:58.020 --> 00:19:59.800
You're exaggerating.

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:03.460
Well, don't be like that. Have a bowl.

00:20:03.460 --> 00:20:04.800
It's delicious.

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:06.860
Here.

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:08.800
Thank you very much.

00:20:10.570 --> 00:20:11.640
Green onions.

00:20:12.300 --> 00:20:16.310
Kondou-san cut them himself.

00:20:17.010 --> 00:20:20.820
Yeah. Green onions help against a cold.

00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:24.740
I see. Then I won't hold back.

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:28.550
How is it?

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:30.830
It's tasty.

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:32.190
I see.

00:20:38.580 --> 00:20:39.800
Thanks for the food.

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:41.420
Sure. Well,

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:44.850
if you'd like, I can make some for you any time.

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:46.840
Thank you.

00:20:47.400 --> 00:20:51.100
I'm glad that you're here, Chizuru-chan.

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:53.470
Okita-san?

00:20:53.470 --> 00:20:56.850
But please spare me from the green onions, 'kay?

00:20:58.260 --> 00:20:59.860
You don't like them?

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:02.110
Keep this a secret from Kondou-san.

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:05.690
Sure.

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:13.490
Chizuru-chan, let's go!

00:21:13.490 --> 00:21:15.500
Ah, please wait!

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:28.000
I can... still fight.

00:23:02.070 --> 00:23:03.070
Ojou-sama,

00:23:03.070 --> 00:23:05.090
please leave this to me and run.

00:23:05.090 --> 00:23:07.860
Any more rudeness from you

00:23:07.860 --> 00:23:09.110
and I will not forgive you.

00:23:09.110 --> 00:23:12.110
I'm the bodyguard for the Sumiya.

00:23:12.110 --> 00:23:14.110
B-Bodyguard?

00:23:12.110 --> 00:23:14.110
Chapter Two
The Fire Hidden in Winter
